  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Hand Pies.png|200px|left|Hand pies]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |level = 91|price = 1 to 295|time = 20 min|xp = 35|source = {{Infoicon|deepfr|bigger|link=Deep Fryer}}|base = 82|dia = 2|time3 = 17 min|title = [[Products|Product]]}}\n'''Hand pies''' are a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 91.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making hand pies'''===\n[[File:Deep_Fryer.png|150px|left|Deep Fryer]]\nHand pies are made in the [[Deep Fryer]].\n\nTo make hand pies, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Apple Jam.png|75px|Apple Jam|link=Apple Jam]]\n|[[File:Egg.png|75px|Egg|link=Egg]]\n|[[File:Wheat.png|75px|Wheat|link=Wheat]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x5'''\n|}\nIt takes 20 minutes to make one serving, and 17 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] machine. Each serving gives players 35 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling hand pies'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Hand pies can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,952 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 servings.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make hand pies costs 270 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 2 to 3 servings of hand pies per crate, up to a total of 9 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* Keep plenty of apple jam in stock to produce hand pies.\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Hand-Pies\n|es = Empanadas de manzana\n|fr = Beignets aux Pommes\n|it = Fagottini dolci\n|nl = Gevulde Pasteitjes\n|no = Håndpai\n|ru = Пирожки\n|zh = Hand Pies\n}}\n[[pt-br:Tortinhas]]\n\n[[Category:Deep Fryer Products]]\n[[Category:Egg Products]]\n[[Category:Wheat Products]]\n[[Category:Apple Jam Products]]",
